(7426090, 1172809, 156466, '<td valign="top">Stared at this a long time and I want to really, really like it, but I find everything on the car gorgeous and everything outside of it soooooo distracting.  Perhaps had you vignetted it a little or done a vertical crop?  Really striking, but not quite there for me.</td>', 'Stared at this a long time and I want to really, really like it, but I find everything on the car gorgeous and everything outside of it soooooo distracting.  Perhaps had you vignetted it a little or done a vertical crop?  Really striking, but not quite there for me.', '2016-01-07 06:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
