(7426094, 1171266, 156466, '<td valign="top">Did you tighten the crop since the one you showed us?  I like this better.  Or I just like it more now looking at it anew.  Great photo, Rob.  (no vote)</td>', 'Did you tighten the crop since the one you showed us?  I like this better.  Or I just like it more now looking at it anew.  Great photo, Rob.  (no vote)', '2016-01-07 06:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7426095, 1172766, 156466, '<td valign="top">A couple dust spots need to be fixed, and the leaning in perspective bothers me a bit (is it like that or is the curvature in the lens? - I''m assuming the latter).  Appears as if you may have isolated the sky in post for processing as I''m seeing both some haloing (left tower) and some strong edges, and the sky seems unnaturally dark for the lighting on the building.  Nice photo, just needs a second look at the processing.</td>', 'A couple dust spots need to be fixed, and the leaning in perspective bothers me a bit (is it like that or is the curvature in the lens? - I''m assuming the latter).  Appears as if you may have isolated the sky in post for processing as I''m seeing both some haloing (left tower) and some strong edges, and the sky seems unnaturally dark for the lighting on the building.  Nice photo, just needs a second look at the processing.', '2016-01-07 06:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7426096, 1172599, 156466, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture.</td>', 'Outstanding capture.', '2016-01-07 06:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7426097, 1172764, 156466, '<td valign="top">Trying to decide if the people under his leg add or detract from this.  Regardless, his face made me chuckle immediately.</td>', 'Trying to decide if the people under his leg add or detract from this.  Regardless, his face made me chuckle immediately.', '2016-01-07 06:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7426098, 1172405, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m taking a guess that this was somewhere on the left side of "Watergate", Neil?</td>', 'I''m taking a guess that this was somewhere on the left side of "Watergate", Neil?', '2016-01-07 06:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7426099, 1172439, 156466, '<td valign="top">(Advise, not criticism - no impact on my vote) The light gray background here robs the full effect of this wonderful shot, particularly in a vertical orientation.  All the detail in shadows is lost until I put my hands up to the left and right side of it and block the monitor.  In the future you may want to preview it against a light background to tweak the edit for this site.</td>', '(Advise, not criticism - no impact on my vote) The light gray background here robs the full effect of this wonderful shot, particularly in a vertical orientation.  All the detail in shadows is lost until I put my hands up to the left and right side of it and block the monitor.  In the future you may want to preview it against a light background to tweak the edit for this site.', '2016-01-07 06:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7426100, 1172855, 156466, '<td valign="top">I know the work it takes to do these.  Very impressive.</td>', 'I know the work it takes to do these.  Very impressive.', '2016-01-07 06:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
