(7426181, 1172295, 163081, '<td valign="top">This can''t be a setup. Superb framing. Great composition. This is my top pick for the blue. A 10 and my Blue Dragon Award<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173261" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173261.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173261.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173261.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This can''t be a setup. Superb framing. Great composition. This is my top pick for the blue. A 10 and my Blue Dragon Award', '2016-01-07 11:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7426188, 1172739, 163081, '<td valign="top">My top 2 picture. The colors are super, not oversaturated. It has everything to make it a picture proud to put in a photographer''s portfolio. It''s almost like watching a film...I can hear the wind blowing, see the sand moving while the man is walking.<br/>I give it a 10 and the Red Dragon Award<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173262" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg"/></a></td>', 'My top 2 picture. The colors are super, not oversaturated. It has everything to make it a picture proud to put in a photographer''s portfolio. It''s almost like watching a film...I can hear the wind blowing, see the sand moving while the man is walking.I give it a 10 and the Red Dragon Award', '2016-01-07 12:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7426189, 1172449, 109227, '<td valign="top">Nice Christmas photo.  I would like to see a little less contrast on the faces to make them softer.  Just a thought.</td>', 'Nice Christmas photo.  I would like to see a little less contrast on the faces to make them softer.  Just a thought.', '2016-01-07 12:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7426190, 1172775, 163081, '<td valign="top">My top 3 picture. This is so spooky. Like there is a ghost Viking ship ready to be seen in the mist. Love the processing. I give you a 10 and the Yellow Dragon Award.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173263" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg"/></a></td>', 'My top 3 picture. This is so spooky. Like there is a ghost Viking ship ready to be seen in the mist. Love the processing. I give you a 10 and the Yellow Dragon Award.', '2016-01-07 12:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
