(7426198, 1172741, 163081, '<td valign="top">Top 5. Super shot. Very professional picture. Should fit well in a National Geographic magazine. Nice framing because can really see how low the owl is flying. 9 from me. (would give it a 10 if the dry plant was cropped out on the left side next to the wing)</td>', 'Top 5. Super shot. Very professional picture. Should fit well in a National Geographic magazine. Nice framing because can really see how low the owl is flying. 9 from me. (would give it a 10 if the dry plant was cropped out on the left side next to the wing)', '2016-01-07 12:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
