(7429018, 1172340, 113591, '<td valign="top">No comment, an 32''nd! My fault as well, I only gave it 6. <br/> <br/>Now upgraded to 10.<br/> <br/>One looks at the background, and can get the setting.<br/>One looks at the hands and can see the labour.<br/>One looks at the bag and jersey and sees the monetary stand.<br/> <br/>But one looks at the face and feels life and death.<br/> <br/>Thanks.<br/></td>', 'No comment, an 32''nd! My fault as well, I only gave it 6.  Now upgraded to 10. One looks at the background, and can get the setting.One looks at the hands and can see the labour.One looks at the bag and jersey and sees the monetary stand. But one looks at the face and feels life and death. Thanks.', '2016-01-17 05:52:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7430746, 1172844, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Let''s see...125/126...ouch.  Been there, done that.  There is visible handshake here, blah lighting, nice focus on the lens but that''s it. Free Studies are always pretty tough because you''re up against everyone else''s best work, so it''s best to always bring your A game when you enter.  Entering weak images is just shooting yourself(ie) in the footie.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps, I know you can do a lot better!<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Let''s see...125/126...ouch.  Been there, done that.  There is visible handshake here, blah lighting, nice focus on the lens but that''s it. Free Studies are always pretty tough because you''re up against everyone else''s best work, so it''s best to always bring your A game when you enter.  Entering weak images is just shooting yourself(ie) in the footie. Hope this helps, I know you can do a lot better! Susan', '2016-01-21 18:57:14.000000', NULL, 0),
