(7581818, 1172599, 67145, '<td valign="top">i was looking at this dumbfounded .. how amazing .. and at 200th second .. and i thought those birds wings moved really fast .. <br/>had a brain freeze for a second or ten .. couldnt work it out .. then i read your comment .. of course .. silly me .. <br/>another lesson learned ..  if i ever had the opportunity to photograph humming birds i''d try and remember the multiflash technique ... we dont have them in australia .. so i might use it on bees ..!!! .. :)<br/> <br/>anyway .. its such a wonderful shot .. and i''m extremely impressed with the lens .. and the photographer of course .. !! .. <br/></td>', 'i was looking at this dumbfounded .. how amazing .. and at 200th second .. and i thought those birds wings moved really fast .. had a brain freeze for a second or ten .. couldnt work it out .. then i read your comment .. of course .. silly me .. another lesson learned ..  if i ever had the opportunity to photograph humming birds i''d try and remember the multiflash technique ... we dont have them in australia .. so i might use it on bees ..!!! .. :) anyway .. its such a wonderful shot .. and i''m extremely impressed with the lens .. and the photographer of course .. !! .. ', '2018-07-14 00:13:47.000000', NULL, 0);
